---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer | ExamHub.pk"
  description="Important disclaimer regarding the use of ExamHub.pk."
>
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300">Last Updated: October 13, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 prose prose-lg">
    <h2>1. General Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      The information provided on ExamHub.pk is intended for educational purposes only. While we strive to ensure that all content is accurate and up-to-date, ExamHub.pk makes no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, regarding the accuracy, reliability, or completeness of the information presented.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Exam Information</h2>
    <p>
      Exam syllabi, patterns, schedules, and other official information change frequently. Always verify all exam details with the official examining bodies:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Federal Public Service Commission (FPSC)</li>
      <li>Provincial Public Service Commissions (PPSC, KPPSC, SPSC, BPSC)</li>
      <li>National Testing Service (NTS)</li>
      <li>Inter-Services Selection Board (ISSB)</li>
      <li>Higher Education Commission (HEC) for university admissions</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      ExamHub.pk is not affiliated with any of these organizations and does not represent their official information.
    </p>

    <h2>3. MCQ Accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      While all MCQs on our site are carefully reviewed, we cannot guarantee that they perfectly match official exam questions or that answers are universally agreed upon in all contexts. We recommend using our MCQs as practice tools, not as the sole basis for exam preparation.
    </p>

    <h2>4. No Professional Advice</h2>
    <p>
      The content on ExamHub.pk is not professional, legal, financial, or medical advice. For such advice, consult with qualified professionals in the relevant field.
    </p>

    <h2>5. No Guarantees of Success</h2>
    <p>
      Using ExamHub.pk resources does not guarantee success in any exam. Your results depend on various factors including study effort, understanding of concepts, time management, and personal capability. ExamHub.pk is a study aid, not a guarantee of exam success.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      All content on ExamHub.pk is original and owned by ExamHub.pk or its contributors. Unauthorized reproduction, distribution, or use of any content without permission is prohibited.
    </p>

    <h2>7. External Links</h2>
    <p>
      ExamHub.pk may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of these third-party sites. Use external links at your own risk.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permissible by law, ExamHub.pk and its owners, employees, and affiliates shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or related to your use of this site or its content.
    </p>

    <h2>9. User Responsibility</h2>
    <p>
      Users are responsible for verifying any information obtained from ExamHub.pk with official sources before making important decisions based on that information.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Changes to Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to update this disclaimer at any time without notice. Your continued use of ExamHub.pk constitutes your acceptance of any changes.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this disclaimer, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
